  "details": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the AigcWordTemplateController deleteBatch handler that allows low-privileged authenticated users to delete word templates. Attackers can send a DELETE request to /airag/word/deleteBatch with comma-separated ids to permanently delete any templates in the shared library.",
